{
  "id": "u14-l02",
  "unit": "u14-feelings-health",
  "title": "What's wrong? (with friends)",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**তুই** is for your closest friends and brothers and sisters (U2). Its verbs end in **-িস**: **তুই ঠিক আছিস?** 'Are you OK?', **কী করছিস?** 'What are you doing?', **কাঁদছিস কেন?** 'Why are you crying?' The object form is **তোকে** 'you'.\n\n**A তুই command is the bare stem.** Take the তুমি command and drop the final **-ো**: **বসো → বস** 'sit', **শোনো → শোন** 'listen', **বলো → বল** 'tell'. You know one already: **দে** 'give!'.\n\n**'Don't' with তুই** is the present + **না**: **চিন্তা করিস না** 'don't worry'.\n\nThe caring question: **কী হয়েছে তোর?** 'What's wrong?'",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "thik",
      "bn": "ঠিক",
      "tr": "thik",
      "en": "all right; OK",
      "notes": "ঠিক + আছ-: ঠিক আছি 'I'm OK', তুই ঠিক আছিস? 'are you OK?' (তুমি ঠিক আছো?, আপনি ঠিক আছেন?). ঠিক আছে 'OK' (U6)."
    },
    {
      "id": "korchhish",
      "bn": "করছিস",
      "tr": "korchhish",
      "en": "you (intimate) are doing",
      "notes": "তুই present continuous: -ছিস. করছি · করছো · করছেন · করছিস. কী করছিস? 'What are you up to?'"
    },
    {
      "id": "kadchhish",
      "bn": "কাঁদছিস",
      "tr": "ka~dchhish",
      "en": "you (intimate) are crying",
      "notes": "কাঁদা 'cry'. কাঁদছিস কেন? 'Why are you crying?'"
    },
    {
      "id": "toke",
      "bn": "তোকে",
      "tr": "toke",
      "en": "you (intimate, object)",
      "notes": "Object form of তুই, like তোমাকে (তুমি) and আপনাকে (আপনি)."
    },
    {
      "id": "bosh",
      "bn": "বস",
      "tr": "bosh",
      "en": "sit (intimate)",
      "notes": "তুই command = the bare stem: বসো → বস. Also spelled বোস."
    },
    {
      "id": "shon",
      "bn": "শোন",
      "tr": "shon",
      "en": "listen (intimate)",
      "notes": "তুই command: শোনো → শোন. Also opens a sentence: শোন, … 'Listen, …'."
    },
    {
      "id": "bol",
      "bn": "বল",
      "tr": "bol",
      "en": "say (intimate)",
      "notes": "তুই command: বলো → বল. বল, কী হয়েছে? 'Tell me, what's wrong?'"
    }
  ],
